  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria Humanitarian Response Programme: Health Pillar - International Medical Corps UK</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project International Medical Corps UK (IMC) deliver lifesaving health services through UK funding in Syria. This includes  primary and secondary healthcare, trauma and emergency services, maternal and newborn health and mental health and psychosocial support. Through this project IMC will pivot over three years from direct health service delivery to health system strengthening with the objective of handing over primary healthcare facilities to the government of Syria by the end of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
